Entity-bearing derived containers hold both their own EntityIds and parent lineage, which serve distinct purposes:

Own EntityId: answers “what is this element’s identity?” — used for grouping, selection, and element-specific operations.
Parent lineage: answers “where did this element come from?” — used for provenance, data-flow visualisation, and tracing.

