Events are stored in a std::map&lt;std::string, PSTHEventOptions&gt; keyed by a user-assigned name (currently the same as the event key). The state emits per-event signals (plotEventAdded, plotEventRemoved, plotEventOptionsChanged) so the UI and renderer can react granularly.

